#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:1 823392c6a50c4268a50068befcc82246
msgid "🌳 Tree structure"
msgstr "🌳 目录结构"

#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:3 90bf592d984943e384b24170b1311f44
msgid ""
"A module is a folder in `modules/`. Its name is its namespace, for "
"example `bs.health`. This page explains what goes in that folder and how "
"to name the files."
msgstr "模块是 `modules/` 中的一个文件夹。它的名称就是它的命名空间，例如 `bs.health`。本页介绍该文件夹中包含什么，以及如何命名文件。"

#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:12 bedc2eb3f6104be6874b82b2e376d5bf
msgid "**Module requirements:**"
msgstr "**模块要求：**"

#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:14 68234c2756e34e7aa769a49b32491eab
msgid "A `module.bs` file. See the [metadata page](project:metadata.md)."
msgstr "一个 `module.bs` 文件。参见[元数据页面](project:metadata.md)。"

#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:15 0e0b3069298c49789768451713f3484d
msgid "A `CHANGELOG.md` file. See the [changelog page](project:changelog.md)."
msgstr "一个 `CHANGELOG.md` 文件。参见[更新日志页面](project:changelog.md)。"

#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:16 b9e8aec7c39b4cd2878c9365fcca3d0a
msgid "A `README.md` file and a `pack.png` image."
msgstr "一个 `README.md` 文件和一张 `pack.png` 图像。"

#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:18 8cfbca99f61e40a1ae33ec6ce35f08b9
msgid "**Feature requirements:**"
msgstr "**特性要求：**"

#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:20 c9c5784e067047609ecaf34eac59b0ec
msgid "Declare each feature in `module.bs`."
msgstr "在 `module.bs` 中声明每个特性。"

#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:21 4dd1c6648f7343ff8f5bf557f738a50c
msgid "Give each function feature its own folder, with a `__main__` function."
msgstr "为每个函数特性建立单独的文件夹，其中包含一个 `__main__` 函数。"

#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:22 e7290ab7d3204ebfa8a07dc9f7e38123
msgid ""
"Name any other feature file after the feature. This applies to "
"predicates, tags, and number providers."
msgstr "其他特性文件以特性命名。这适用于谓词、标签和数值提供器。"

#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:23 79708912c7044f80b531a6f8d34752ae
msgid "Keep each feature small. Split a feature that does several things."
msgstr "保持每个特性小巧。做多件事的特性应当拆分。"

#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:25 118b7df38ea04582aa732fc75f4a5e2e
msgid ""
"Apart from these rules, organize your files as you like. Keep the result "
"consistent."
msgstr "除这些规则外，你可以按自己的方式组织文件。请保持整体一致。"

