#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:59 c2db15e0cb1046269e032f8ede23bebe
msgid "Features and groups"
msgstr "特性与分组"

#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:61 09cce4e83cd6416a9e56e1d074cb675b
msgid ""
"A function feature is a folder. Put every file that only this feature "
"uses in its folder:"
msgstr "函数特性是一个文件夹。把只有该特性使用的文件都放在它的文件夹中："

#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:69 0f7d04c756474eb6be7578723d12afae
msgid ""
"The build generates the function tags from `module.bs`. Don't write "
"`tags/function/<feature>.json` yourself."
msgstr "构建会根据 `module.bs` 生成函数标签。不要自己编写 `tags/function/<feature>.json`。"

#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:71 28c3d4bcafe547eb8790eed73ae8dec1
msgid ""
"A **group** is a folder that contains several features. In `bs.hitbox`, "
"`get_block` is a group. It holds `get_block/collision`, "
"`get_block/outline`, and other features. Put the files that only these "
"features use in the group folder. A feature can't also be a group."
msgstr ""
"**分组**是包含多个特性的文件夹。在 `bs.hitbox` 中，`get_block` 是一个分组。它包含 "
"`get_block/collision`、`get_block/outline` "
"等特性。把只有这些特性使用的文件放在分组文件夹中。一个特性不能同时是分组。"

#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:73 0f98f07348ba48b3bb518a486d91cd16
msgid ""
"Any file outside a feature folder or a group folder is shared. The whole "
"module can use it."
msgstr "特性文件夹和分组文件夹之外的文件都是共享的。整个模块都可以使用它。"

#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:78 9e6c5cb75aec4015889bea71d1bf6399
msgid "Reserved names"
msgstr "保留名称"

#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:80 50375a295f7a4f1a9943fa9f1ba39b1f
msgid ""
"A function name with double underscores on each side has a special "
"meaning. You can't give such a name to a feature."
msgstr "两侧带有双下划线的函数名具有特殊含义。你不能给特性起这样的名称。"

#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:83 6d774ec7ea2249c7b3a5a2b2bf26b9c5
msgid "`__main__`"
msgstr "`__main__`"

#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:84 7b6884651d034798a7bac9cc34252f0a
msgid "The function that the feature tag runs: `#<module>:<feature>`"
msgstr "特性标签运行的函数：`#<module>:<feature>`"

#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:85 06f2a0ae4c344d839af43a5978184302
msgid "`__macro__`"
msgstr "`__macro__`"

#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:86 11a4bad7206a4b7d9af3c44ac98d1814
msgid ""
"The function that the `.in` tag runs: `#<module>:<feature>.in`. The build"
" generates it for `input arguments`, unless you write it"
msgstr "`.in` 标签运行的函数：`#<module>:<feature>.in`。构建会为 `input arguments` 生成它，除非你自己编写"

#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:87 5bfd251829dc46b9b6f2dbaf9dceb660
msgid "`__load__`"
msgstr "`__load__`"

#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:88 2a4e76d7dc1b4b5fa65d82b8ba313ccc
msgid ""
"The function that runs when the module loads. The build generates it if "
"it's missing"
msgstr "模块加载时运行的函数。缺失时构建会生成它"

#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:89 fff0966156d140eda83124a702092abc
msgid "`__unload__`"
msgstr "`__unload__`"

#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:90 2a4e76d7dc1b4b5fa65d82b8ba313ccc
msgid ""
"The function that runs when the module unloads. The build generates it if"
" it's missing"
msgstr "模块卸载时运行的函数。缺失时构建会生成它"

#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:91 c17954c9fbb44d13b344706f10ec5537
msgid "`__help__`"
msgstr "`__help__`"

#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:92 b29f28391f254f0bab253047c42badf8
msgid ""
"The function that links to the module documentation. The build always "
"generates it"
msgstr "链接到模块文档的函数。构建总是会生成它"

#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:96 7336333b3cc54b70ab1e79f48513c5c1
msgid "Load and unload"
msgstr "加载与卸载"

#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:98 8fe7e00bc620436aa90aa49356819430
msgid ""
"The build removes the storages that you declare in `module.bs`. Remove "
"any other data yourself."
msgstr "构建会移除你在 `module.bs` 中声明的存储。其他数据请自己移除。"

#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:100 3359caa667e3413b94cb930b1a1c18e4
msgid ""
"A feature or a group can have its own `__load__` and `__unload__` "
"functions in its folder. They run after the functions of the module."
msgstr "特性或分组可以在其文件夹中拥有自己的 `__load__` 和 `__unload__` 函数。它们在模块的函数之后运行。"

#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:105 adab787b257c407d8f5397846cdc7467
msgid "Public and private files"
msgstr "公共文件与私有文件"

#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:107 50e717ef75414c5796b8b54c41a6d4da
msgid ""
"Users call a function through the function tag of its feature. A function"
" needs no marker. Never add a `_` prefix to a function."
msgstr "用户通过特性的函数标签调用函数。函数不需要任何标记。绝不要给函数加 `_` 前缀。"

#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:109 783e5e20bdcd497cbff46b4132c45a17
msgid ""
"Users can call any other file by its ID. This applies to predicates, "
"tags, number providers, and advancements. Each of these files is either "
"public or private:"
msgstr "用户可以通过 ID 调用其他任何文件。这适用于谓词、标签、数值提供器和进度。这些文件要么是公共的，要么是私有的："

#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:111 5ff5307dab8749768a1c9a2b5322e7a8
msgid "**Public**: declare the file as a feature in `module.bs`."
msgstr "**公共**：在 `module.bs` 中将文件声明为特性。"

#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:112 acc7dadc4c494e9dad98d054474ed1bb
msgid "**Private**: add a `_` prefix to the file name or to one of its folders."
msgstr "**私有**：为文件名或其某一级文件夹添加 `_` 前缀。"

#: ../../contribute/tree-structure.md:114 0220759de285428f9078b051b8267c05
msgid "For example:"
msgstr "例如："

